{"timestamp":"2026-10-11T02:55:42.118Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"The native council is now debating charging, including challenges and rebuttals. The voice test also confirmed that the spoken answer came from the saved Judge assessment through local Qwen. I’m checking the PM review handoff and fixing the pause/resume accounting before relying on the full run’s results.","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
